WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
[Northern lights ripple across the night sky]

00:08.000 --> 00:20.000
[Green ribbons of light drift over Lapland]

00:20.000 --> 00:40.000
[The aurora brightens above the trees]

00:40.000 --> 01:10.000
[Waves of light move across the horizon]

01:10.000 --> 02:08.000
[The northern sky, alive with light]
